  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dagger/dagger/zipball/v0.21.11",
  "body": "## v0.21.11 - 2026-10-21\n\n### Fixed\n- Fix Go module codegen failing with `import cycle not allowed` in OpenTelemetry packages by @sipsma in https://github.com/dagger/dagger/pull/14646 \\\n  Generated modules now pin `github.com/dagger/otel-go` and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk`\n  instead of resolving them to their latest versions, which pulled\n  `go.opentelemetry.io/otel` v1.47.0 into a cycle with the pinned `otel/log` v0.16.0.\n- Fix engine memory growth from schema servers retained after their sessions end by @sipsma in https://github.com/dagger/dagger/pull/14756 \\\n  Cached results, types, module resolvers and module dependency schemas no longer keep\n  session schema servers alive, so long-running engines stop accumulating heap until OOM-killed.\n\n### What to do next?\n- Read the [documentation](https://docs.dagger.io)\n- Join our [Discord server](https://discord.gg/dagger-io)\n- Follow us on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/dagger_io)\n\n",
  "mentions_count": 1
